WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.730
Your talk is over.

2
00:00:01.780 --> 00:00:03.030
Relief.

3
00:00:03.080 --> 00:00:06.030
Then a hand goes up at
the back of the room.

4
00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:08.710
The question is one you never practised.

5
00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:11.520
A timer starts: five seconds.

6
00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:14.250
Your head fills with scrambled words.

7
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:18.030
So what do strong speakers do,
in those next five seconds?

8
00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:20.830
In this mission, you'll
test your instincts.

9
00:00:20.880 --> 00:00:23.410
Start talking at once,
to fill the silence?

10
00:00:23.460 --> 00:00:25.490
Fall back on a bit you practised?

11
00:00:25.540 --> 00:00:29.620
You'll build a frame for your
reply, one stepping stone at a time.

12
00:00:29.670 --> 00:00:33.900
And you'll practise what to do when a
listener pushes back against your view.

13
00:00:33.950 --> 00:00:37.510
Your mission: find out what
strong speakers do next.
